Have you ever wondered how your operating system knows that an update is genuinely from Apple or Microsoft and not malware created by a hacker?

Plaintext
[ Apple / Software Developer ]
  • Writes an OS update file.
  • Locks a digital stamp using Apple's PRIVATE KEY.
         │
         ▼
[ Your Device ]
  • Downloads the update file from the internet.
  • Reads the stamp using Apple's PUBLIC KEY (which comes pre-installed in the OS).
  • If the public key unlocks it, your device knows 100% that the code came from Apple and was never modified in transit.
